		line=873,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Two moons have come and gone since Tooru's death.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto passed judgment which exonerated him of all his crimes.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Truthfully, however, his actions were simply so aberrant that they belied any rational explanation.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"As such, House Inou was spared from extirpation, and the headship was succeeded by its eldest son.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Unlike his father, this man possesses extraordinary talent in the blade arts.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"In time, he will surely be renowned as the foremost blademaster in the realm.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Immediately after putting down the rebellion, Himi-no-Mikoto began overseeing the construction of a small temple deep within the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"It is surely being prepared for a ritual of grave importance.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"With the exception of a few select priestesses, none─not even I─know of its true purpose.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I've kept you waiting, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Having instructed me to wait on her in her chambers, Himi-no-Mikoto finally arrives.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"As of late, her complexion has appeared decidedly pale and haggard.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Though I am loath to believe it, her death is unmistakably drawing near.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Forgive the abruptness, but you must lay with me.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I blink, not quite comprehending what she just said.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Obviously a man and a woman laying together means for them to engage in amorous relations!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why must you always make me explain such things?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Blushing, Himi-no-Mikoto turns away in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“J-Just a minute.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I understand what amorous relations are... but why the two of us?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What might be the matter? 'Tis most unlike you to be so flustered.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You would not hesitate to fell a thousand men, yet still tremble at the prospect of embracing a woman for the first time?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto flashes me a taunting smile.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Well, have ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" ever been intimate with a man?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Absolutely not! I am a priestess, you know!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"She sputters in indignation.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Then you're no different from me.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I-I suppose so...”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wai─none of that matters!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heed me and disrobe at once!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Apparently this is no jest, and she seriously intends for me to lay with her.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"But is this truly all right?",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am prepared to obey any order whatsoever.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But I have no intentions to lay with mine lord without reason.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I recognize the contradiction in mine words even as I explain myself.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"If I claim to be willing to obey any order, then I should simply do as I'm told without any further objections.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even you need a good reason, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto shows me a wan smile.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I am preparing to carry out a ritual which will create a vessel for my soul.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As you are well aware, I have no heir, nor am I able to bear a child.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Should I die now, the Empire is sure to fall into disunion.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Thus, I came to my decision.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I shall be reborn.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto declares, her eyes fixed on mine own.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“By transmigrating my soul into a new corporeal form.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You intend to renew your own body?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In simple terms, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I will be born again in a new body.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"If Himi-no-Mikoto says it, surely it is not out of the realm of possibility.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This ritual requires two essential elements.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto holds up a pair of fingers.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The first is a Crystal of Life.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The other is a mother who will bear the Crystal within her and give birth to the child.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I understand the need for a mother, but what is this Crystal of Life?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto tenderly traces her fingers over her own abdomen.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Inside my womb, I must imbue a man's essence with my magicks... and in doing so, conceive a Crystal of Life.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Following that, the Crystal must be transplanted into a body capable of sustaining the child.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If everything succeeds, my soul will be granted a new body and be reborn into this world once more.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I see. Himi-no-Mikoto must lay with a man as a necessary part of the ritual.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I understand. I accept.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmh, so you will...”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto whispers to me, a forlorn expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Ever since that day─ever since I vowed to open mine heart to her and stay by her side, I've been a changed man.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Or rather, I've done everything in mine power to change myself.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Hence, I can tell that right now─",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She is weeping on the inside.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am sorry, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why do you apologize?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am sure mine actions must have once again made you sad.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Why else would you show me a face like that?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Hearing mine reply, Himi-no-Mikoto smiles faintly.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, you've truly turned into a wonderful man.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto murmurs, gently nestling herself against mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In truth, all this simple woman yearns for... is to become one with you.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'd always believed that you would never comprehend these feelings of mine.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Yet you did...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"She peers up at me, her eyes swirling with passion.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“All because I dared to dream this silly dream...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's right.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"All around us, peach petals flutter into being.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Her lovely, precious teardrops wordlessly cascade to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In that case... it need only be this once, but please...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Tell me you love me, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even if only during this ritual, won't you grant me your love?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Tearlessly weeping her heart out, Himi-no-Mikoto begs me to love her.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Seeing her like this, a burning tightness wrenches at the inside of mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"A sensation the likes of which I've never felt before.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, I am far from being the man you wish me to be.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...I still do not know the meaning of love.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It's all right, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But... this much, I do know for certain.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, I do not wish to see you cry.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I would gladly give up mine everything, if only it meant that you would smile.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“All I know is this.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, thank you...”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are already a better man than any I could have ever wished for.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Her simple words send an irrepressible impulse surging up from deep within mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Unthinkingly, I throw mine arms around the woman in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You fool. You'll hurt me if you use that much strength.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto laughs, even as the whirlwind of peach petals draws closer and enfolds us.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"When I slacken mine arms, Himi-no-Mikoto stretches up on her tiptoes and whispers in mine ear.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Lay with me, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I will.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Leaning deep into mine embrace, Himi-no-Mikoto brushes the tip of her nose against mine.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Aah, Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Even as I topple backwards onto the floor, Himi-no-Mikoto brings her face ever closer.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Let me get a good look at your face, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You see it all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“No, this is the first...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Finally knowing how you feel... 'tis like seeing you for the very first time.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She's so close I can see the moisture clinging to each of her long eyelashes, yet I'm unable to look away.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I've always wanted you to look into my eyes... just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Just for now... just like this... won't you grant me all your love?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Held in rapture by Himi-no-Mikoto's feverish gaze, a strange heat begins to course through mine body.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I suppose I should ask, but have you yet to kiss a woman?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No, I haven't.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heheh, wonderful.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto smiles sweetly.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Would you like to?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Indeed, I would.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, won't you have my lips?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I answer by pulling her close, gently laying mine lips atop hers.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Nmmh... ahhn, nnhh...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“*Smooch...* Nngh...! Aah, Mitsurugi...!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Immediately, I'm overcome by a dizzying sensation.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I can think of nothing else save for the softness spreading across mine lips.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"To savor the taste of her even deeper, I pull Himi-no-Mikoto closer to me.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Never would I have imagined that the simple act of touching mine lips to hers could be so entrancing.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Nh... ahhn, *smack,* Mitsurugi...! Ahmh, nhaah...!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"─How dear she is to me.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"This single thought sets mine tempest-tossed mind ablaze with passion.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Our lips finally part, yet we never look away from the depths of each other's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... haah... How incredible a mere kiss can be...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Just from meeting lips with you, my body feels like it could melt away.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see you're quite fond of kissing.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“How could I not be? I have always dreamed of this moment.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Right now, my heart feels so full that I fear it may burst.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Won't you... feel for yourself just how fast my heart is beating, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The two of us sink into a single tangled mess of limbs.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Our bodies are pressed so closely that we can feel the beating of each other's hearts.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"She bashfully averts her eyes, lightly clearing her throat.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You may entrust the magicks to me.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Also... Please... look at me as a woman... and grant me all your love.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I already love you with all mine heart.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's face flushes bright red.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“H-How dare you...? Do you mean to make me blush... saying things like that?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You are all the lovelier with a blush on your face.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“C-Cease it... If you persist... you'll make me want to show you more of these unseemly expressions...”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto turns her face away, but it's an entirely futile gesture when we're this close to each other.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'll be as gentle as I can.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Of course. I believe you, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Her voice contains not a single trace of doubt.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I feel a twinge in mine chest as I stare into her eyes brimming with trust.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It's time to wake up from this dream... and return to the waking world.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The waking world?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The world where I am your lord and you are my blade.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I thank you for your service in performing this ritual with me.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But you needn't force yourself any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto buries her face in mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Behind her, a single peach petal flutters forlornly down to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Though I can't see her expression, I can feel her soft, frail body trembling with loneliness as she clings feebly to me.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"This time, I am the one to lock her in mine embrace as she tries to pull away.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You ought not overestimate me, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am not clever enough by half to pretend to love another.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“When I told you I loved you, when I told you I wanted to be with you, I meant it all.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“D-Do you truly mean it?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If you would grant me this, I shall continue to love you for as long as you live.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"─Ah, how fair, how noble these fluttering petals of Persica are.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You fool... What a complete and utter fool you are...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto throws her arms around mine neck, and I seal her lips with a kiss.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“*Smooch...* *Smooch, smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"The first thing I see as we slowly pull apart is that smile of hers, radiant as the sun.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, I love you.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...I just might end up believing you, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Yeah, please believe it.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto returns mine embrace.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, I love you, too.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Within the billows of these tempestuous peach petals, the two of us hold each other close, that two hearts might eventually come together as one.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
